          "distinct": true,
          "id": "54953466132ff46df85d80d7cec6f9020e3fb2d1",
          "message": "Added new value move constructor and move assign operator (#1204)\n\n* Added new value move constructor and move assign operator\n\nThis allows values to be moved into an Any rather than copied. Also added a test case which counts\nthe number of copies and moves that happen in some code and ensures that the totals are correct.\n\n* added tests to count default construction and number of destructors\n\n* add in \"-Wno-error=maybe-uninitialized\" for the ARM platform.\n\n* try a different way to fix the maybe-uninialized error\n\n* Try #3\n\n* Try #4\n\n* Try #5\n\n* Try #6\n\n* Try #8\n\n* Try #9\n\n* Try #10\n\n* Try #10.1\n\n* made move constructor and move assignment noexcept in test class\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: carneyweb <mike@carneywb.com>",
          "timestamp": "2025-09-22T11:21:18-04:00",
