          "message": "Upgrade miniz to 3.1.1 and remove custom patches (#1239)\n\n* Upgrade miniz (testing to see if our patches are required)\n\n* changes for successful compilation on macOS\n\n* changes to allow executables on macOS to use same logic as dylibs\n\n* Fixed page-alignment bug related to ELF linker-embedded zips and Mach-O embedded zips when zip is large\n\n* Updated third-party information regarding miniz, removed unnecessary patch file\n\n* Cleanup for PR\n\n* Fixup warnings\n\n* Addressed feedback\n\n* Addressed more feedback\n\n* more changes\n\n* More feedback changes, added extra tests",
